@startuml
title DamTap - Use Cases
left to right direction
actor Customer
actor "Food Business" as Business
actor Administrator
rectangle DamTap {
 usecase "Browse offers" as Browse
 usecase "Search/filter/sort" as Search
 usecase "View pickup and allergens" as View
 usecase "Save local favorite" as Fav
 usecase "Reserve portion" as Reserve
 usecase "Submit partner application" as Apply
 usecase "Create offer via admin API" as Create
 usecase "Authenticate [planned]" as Auth
 usecase "Manage own offers [planned]" as Manage
 usecase "Configure dynamic pricing [planned]" as Price
 usecase "Cancel reservation [planned]" as Cancel
 usecase "Confirm pickup [planned]" as Pickup
}
Customer --> Browse
Customer --> Search
Customer --> View
Customer --> Fav
Customer --> Reserve
Business --> Apply
Administrator --> Create
Customer ..> Auth
Business ..> Auth
Business ..> Manage
Business ..> Price
Customer ..> Cancel
Business ..> Pickup
note right of Reserve
Current: server-authoritative total
and transactional stock decrement.
end note
@enduml
